direction: right
label: "What one telephone conversation can know and do\nWhat can the voice agent do?\nA fresh brief supplies facts and authority. The configured model can wait, select menu digits, handle voicemail and hang up. Corrected text examples and one real voicemail were accepted; physical keypad delivery and acoustic hold timing remain unverified."
n_voice_agent: "ElevenLabs telephone agent\nAgent - chooses its next action | EXISTING\nUses supplied facts and authority to conduct one conversation; behavior requires checking against evidence." {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#fee2e2"
  style.stroke: "#dc2626"
}
legend: "Key - colors and shapes identify roles" {
keyagent: "Agent - chooses its next action" {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#fee2e2"
  style.stroke: "#dc2626"
}
keylines: "Solid arrow: synchronous call or data transfer. Dashed arrow: asynchronous, scheduled, or agent launch."
}
